<item>
            <title>[PARQUET-3] tool to merge pull requests based on Spark</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-3</link>
                <project id="12315521" key="PARQUET">Parquet</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-parquet-mr/pull/5&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-parquet-mr/pull/5&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;given a pull request id on github.com/apache/incubator-parquet-mr this script will merge it&lt;br/&gt;
requires 2 remotes: apache-github and apache to point to the corresponding repos.&lt;br/&gt;
tested here (pretending my fork is the apache remote):&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/julienledem/incubator-parquet-mr/commit/485658a5b7654198ab1fcc77e2b850ee12999491&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/julienledem/incubator-parquet-mr/commit/485658a5b7654198ab1fcc77e2b850ee12999491&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;original tool:&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/spark/blob/master/dev/merge_spark_pr.py&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/spark/blob/master/dev/merge_spark_pr.py&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
